# 生产 Caddy 配置的版本库镜像（2026-11-17 拉取自 8.152.204.21:/opt/aition-config/Caddyfile）
# 生效方式：宿主该文件挂载进 aition-ows-caddy 容器的 /etc/caddy/Caddyfile
# 修改流程（先改仓库再同步，勿在服务器上手改）：
#   scp -i ~/.ssh/car_service_deploy_v2 infra/Caddyfile root@8.152.204.21:/opt/aition-config/Caddyfile
#   ssh root@8.152.204.21 "docker exec aition-ows-caddy caddy validate --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile && docker exec aition-ows-caddy caddy reload --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile"
